OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788185971
OL,3,CUefa chief Aleksander Ceferin rules
OL,4,Cout bid for Fifa presidency
OL,6,FUefa president Aleksander Ceferin has
OL,7,Fruled himself out of the running to
OL,8,Freplace Gianni Infantino but warned a
OL,9,Fcandidate may challenge the
OL,10,Fbeleaguered Fifa chief in March.
OL,12,FInfantino has come under increasing
OL,13,Fpressure to quit following his failed
OL,14,Fplan to sell off stakes in Fifa's
OL,15,Fcompetitions and the World Cup to
OL,16,Fprivate investors.
OL,18,FCeferin expressed his commitment to
OL,19,FUefa in an interview with The Rest Is
OL,20,FPolitics podcast.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788185971
OL,3,CUefa chief Aleksander Ceferin rules
OL,4,Cout bid for Fifa presidency
OL,6,FHe believes that Infantino, previously
OL,7,Fregarded as untouchable in his
OL,8,Fposition as head of football's world
OL,9,Fgoverning body, will either have to
OL,10,Fstep down or face opposition if he
OL,11,Fseeks re-election at the next Fifa
OL,12,FCongress in Morocco.
OL,14,FCeferin, 58, said of replacing
OL,15,FInfantino: "I'm not interested because
OL,16,Fof two reasons. One reason is that I
OL,17,Flove Uefa and I love working here, and
OL,18,FI think that at a certain point...
OL,19,Fit's time to also enjoy life a bit.
OL,26,@wD@LOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788185971
OL,3,CUefa chief Aleksander Ceferin rules
OL,4,Cout bid for Fifa presidency
OL,6,F"And the second point is, my
OL,7,Fcredibility is much, much higher if
OL,8,FI'm not interested in the position."
OL,10,FCeferin led the opposition to
OL,11,FInfantino and revealed he has not
OL,12,Fspoken to him since the start of the
OL,13,Fcontroversy.
OL,15,F"Things are changing every day," added
OL,16,FCeferin.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@dO]wD@AOUwD@`O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788185971
OL,3,CUefa chief Aleksander Ceferin rules
OL,4,Cout bid for Fifa presidency
OL,6,F"Every day there are different
OL,7,Fdiscussions. I didn't speak with him.
OL,8,FBut there are two options. One option
OL,9,Fis that he realises that he doesn't
OL,10,Fhave the support, and that's not only
OL,11,Fa political support of the ones who
OL,12,Fvote, but the political support of
OL,13,Ffootball community, the political
OL,14,Fsupport of fans, the political support
OL,15,Fof the players, former players,
OL,16,Fcoaches.
OL,18,F"And the second option is that he goes
OL,19,Fto the elections in March, but in that
OL,20,Fcase, I think he will have a candidate
OL,21,Fagainst him. I don't know yet who."
OL,26,@nD@AOUzD@AOU}D@cO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
