OL,3,CUefa chief Aleksander Ceferin rules
OL,4,Cout bid for Fifa presidency
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThree confederations ` Uefa, Concacaf
OL,12,Fand the Asian Football Confederation `
OL,13,Fare reported to be mulling over
OL,14,Fbringing a no-confidence vote at the
OL,15,FCongress which would place more doubt
OL,16,Fover Infantino's future. He still
OL,17,Fappears to retain the support of the
OL,18,FAfrican and two South American
OL,19,Fconfederations.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
