PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788185971
OL,3,CUefa chief Aleksander Ceferin rules
OL,4,Cout bid for Fifa presidency
OL,6,FInfantino, an ex-Uefa secretary
OL,7,Fgeneral, had the broad backing of
OL,8,FEuropean nations when he succeeded
OL,9,FSepp Blatter in 2016. The then
OL,10,FFootball Association chairman Greg
OL,11,FDyke endorsed Infantino's campaign,
OL,12,Fcalling him a "straightforward guy".
OL,14,FAll four home nations, along with the
OL,15,FRepublic of Ireland, are among those
OL,16,Fwho have withdrawn their support for
OL,17,FInfantino in the wake of the post-
OL,18,FWorld Cup row.
OL,26,@tD@OOUtD@cO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788185971
OL,3,CUefa chief Aleksander Ceferin rules
OL,4,Cout bid for Fifa presidency
OL,6,FAnd Ceferin dismissed a perceived
OL,7,Fassumption on behalf of Infantino and
OL,8,FFifa that Uefa is acting in the
OL,9,Finterests of some of the most powerful
OL,10,Ffederations and clubs in the world.
OL,12,F"What I hear is that they (Fifa) play
OL,13,Fon, you know, 'arrogant Europe is
OL,14,Fagainst us'," added Ceferin. "'They
OL,15,Fhave enough money, but I help the
OL,16,Fsmall and the poor', and stuff like
OL,17,Fthat.
OL,19,F"But I think someone should remind him
OL,20,Fthat he is a European, and that he was
OL,21,Fsupported by Uefa, which he forgot."
OL,26,@tD@AOUvD@MO]vD@^OU{D@AOU}D@dO]
